Subject: [PATCH 2/2] RD: validate TLAS input and reserve instance ranges
Base: Godot cafc17a192acf67903910a68aeb3c076c0907a4b

Prevalidate instance references and bound range arithmetic before recording;
reserve the first mapped range. GPU alignment and lifetime remain native gates.
Exact-source patch; compilation and native Vulkan validation remain required.

